From e4c7d49c2a437ecd0b1876671c16eb6e8dd40117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yusheng Peng <jiusi0519@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 13:55:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(rclpy): finalize shared type description services

Own the native type-description service with a Node-capturing finalizer so the last implementation copy calls rcl_service_fini before releasing its Node. This removes leaked request/response endpoints without premature destruction of retained copies. Two real RK3588A lifetime regressions pass after RED with identical Python/MDDS/RMW inputs and only the native extension changed; the full local broker Context/process graph and ACK gate also passes.
